<Layout title="Privacy Policy" schemaType="WebPage" description="How Geometry Lab handles data: no accounts, calculations in your browser, Google Analytics visit statistics, no ads, and how to opt out."><article class="article"><div class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</div><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="small-note">Last updated: November 12, 2026</p><p>Geometry Lab is free to use and needs no account. This page explains what happens to data when you visit geometrylab.net.</p>
<h2>What you enter</h2><p>Calculator, solver, and worksheet inputs are processed in your browser. They are not sent to a Geometry Lab server.</p>
<h2>Data saved on your device</h2><p>Practice best scores are saved in your browser’s local storage so you can see them next time. They stay on your device and are removed when you clear your browser data. If you make a cookie choice, it is saved as <code>cookieConsent</code> for 180 days (see Cookie choices below). It holds nothing else.</p>
<h2>Usage statistics</h2><p>We use Google Analytics (measurement ID G-9CCD0H600F) to count visits and see which pages are useful. Google Analytics uses cookies or similar identifiers and collects information such as the pages viewed, the referring site, your approximate location, and your device and browser type. We use this only to improve the site.</p>
<h2>No advertising</h2><p>Geometry Lab shows no ads. No advertising code is loaded on any page, and no advertising cookies are set.</p>
<h2>Other services</h2><p>Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. Our hosting provider processes standard access logs, such as IP address and requested page, to deliver and protect the site.</p>
<h2>Cookie choices</h2><p>Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland see a small cookie banner. Until you choose, Google Analytics runs without cookies. <strong>Accept</strong> allows analytics cookies; <strong>Reject</strong> keeps analytics cookie-free. Your choice is stored in your browser’s local storage under <code>cookieConsent</code> for 180 days, and you can change it at any time with <em>Cookie settings</em> in the footer.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><ul><li>Use <em>Cookie settings</em> in the footer to accept or reject analytics cookies.</li><li>Block or delete cookies in your browser settings. The calculators keep working without them.</li><li>Use a tracker blocker to stop analytics from loading.</li><li>Install Google’s <a class="text-link" href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</li><li>Clear your browser’s site data to remove saved practice scores.</li></ul>
<h2>Children</h2><p>Geometry Lab is an educational site for students and teachers. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children, and the site has no sign-up or contact forms. The printable classroom activities and teacher pages collect nothing either: students complete worksheets on paper or in their teacher’s own assignment, so no student work or names reach this site.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about privacy? Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@geometrylab.net">info@geometrylab.net</a>.</p></article></Layout>
